(41, $t$Stamps Eminence Scholarship, Morrill Scholarship Program, President's Ohio Scholarship, Land Grant Opportunity Scholarship, National Buckeye Scholarship, Maximus Scholarship, Provost Scholarship, Trustees Scholarship$t$),
